{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_01_beg","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_01","title":"緘默不言","storyCode":"TW-1","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_01_beg.txt","sourceHash":"170b84eb369f810d027d3819e24a54b8366443e79a798305f52c44d16c5ff489","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 1上"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"narration","text":"2:10 P.M.    天氣/晴\n萊塔尼亞移動城鎮沃倫姆德，這座昔日繁華的商業都市如今人跡罕見"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"城鎮議事廳"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林·霍索恩長官，你剛才去哪了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"決策會的時候你不在場，讓我們怎麼做決定？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......那在你們決定我兒子命運的時候，我在場嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......那件事，塔佳娜應該已經......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"是，告訴我了。讓塔佳娜來告訴我的。我只是提醒你們一下你們所做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"現在情況怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......感染者們仍舊在抗議，他們甚至開始排斥新加入社區的感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想要什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"他們......他們認為那場火災是有人“別有用心”安排的，他們要為安托醫生和死去的感染者求個說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......別有用心，求個說法，很好，有人在煽動他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是感染者，他們中的大部分也曾是沃倫姆德的居民，他們不會做出這麼低劣的栽贓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們有和那些武裝可疑分子接觸嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......暫時沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，但是那些可疑分子一直在村莊周圍徘徊，我擔心他們會影響到那些抗議者。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是崗哨的聯絡——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"自便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......兩個人？是感染者嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"自稱羅德島？我記得這個名字——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......是安托醫生所屬的公司，唉，該來的遲早要來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"那、那該怎麼辦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"安托醫生是一位值得尊敬的感染者。他們也許是來調查安托醫生的蹤跡的，他們有權利知道真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"放他們進來吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也聽到了，按長官說的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，可是這樣真的沒問題嗎？如果他們和那些武裝人員有關的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"大裂谷，火災，感染者。我們還有疑神疑鬼的餘裕嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"可他們知道所有事情後會怎麼樣？羅德島如果向我們索賠追責，只會讓沃倫姆德雪上加霜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"把他們拒之門外？還是欺騙他們？告訴他們安托醫生帶著礦石病患者們遠足去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道瞞不住，但這件事也不是你說了算的，不怕一萬就怕萬一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"真相不被任何人決定，不過......算了，隨你們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"走？你又要去哪兒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......去解決問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我只負責保證這座城鎮回到正軌，決策過程嘛......你們自己扮家家酒，我不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！喂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你現在很難過，我也知道我們做了很多不太好的事情，但這沒辦法！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道沒辦法，這就是我現在還在心平氣和地同你說話的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的事情交給你們了，你們比較擅長這種事。我去看看其他街道的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林！塞弗林·霍索恩！你現在才是這裡的長官，不要隨便亂跑——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖——他這個人總是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，都是可憐人。塔佳娜，塞弗林，托爾，都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"趕緊把這裡收拾一下，羅德島的人馬上就要到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德，意為第八個月亮，與周圍的七座城鎮共同組合成了萊塔尼亞北部璀璨的商業聚落——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"書上是這麼寫的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不過眼前的景象和“商業聚落”根本搭不上邊啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"是因為“大裂谷”的事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那樣規模的天災並不常見，活性源石裸露在岩壁上，深度也許有上千米，唔啊，回想起來真是觸目驚心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"可是亞葉姐姐......你當時明明在好奇扔一發炮彈下去會怎麼樣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，那是對於活性源石的研究精神，說真的，搞不好真能把整片高地一分為二？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們是勉強繞路抵達了，但這座城鎮估計現在寸步難行吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這種時候還會有遊客？好奇怪的裝束，不會是什麼危險分子吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看看那個尾巴，啊，還有她肩膀上的結晶，是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可是那個裝束，我好像在哪裡見到過......是......嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......亞、亞葉姐姐，就這麼坦蕩蕩地走在街上真的沒關係嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的源石技藝普及帶來了兩點明顯有別於他處的特色，音樂藝術的繁榮，以及，對感染者的寬容態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然會被限制人身自由，但至少當你想要活下去的時候，你可以付出代價贏回生活的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......代價？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"至少是付得起的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就算遠離了中心，也有衝突和糾紛，但沃倫姆德依舊提供了感染者居住的街道......至少她是這麼和我說的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊，有人來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（唔？那個叔叔的裝束......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（是沃倫姆德的憲兵？不如去問問路？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（他朝我們走過來了誒，是來迎接我們的嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（不清楚......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（啊，他點了一支煙。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（他把打火機放進口袋裡了，他換了個手拿煙，他又換了一次手——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（——他頭也不回地走掉了！亞葉姐姐！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那個——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我們是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，羅德島的人，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"政府議事廳就在前面，最高的那座塔下面。看見了嗎，好。會有人在那裡接待你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，謝謝，可請問您是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我？我下班了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我下班了，而我現在不想在公務之外有太多交談......我還有急事處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣，回頭見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......他就這麼走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然有點不講禮貌，不過那個叔叔看起來有什麼心事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......可是我們也很累啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不過好歹給我們指了路，我們還是先去問問本地的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！您在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者們又開始抗議了，其他憲兵都已經過去了，但是現場需要您的指揮——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！您又在抽煙了！是店長們又對您說了什麼對不對？請保持形象，否則怎麼讓居民們信服——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——嗯？您怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......說是，長官來著？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了嗎，長官？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......沒什麼。你一直很敬業，塔佳娜。我很欣賞你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？謝謝誇獎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，那邊兩位，看裝束不是本地人吧？難道是羅德島的醫生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊，正是。我們是羅德島的醫生。請叫我亞葉，這位是鈴蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（醫生？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（要說是醫生......也算是吧。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"（我也算嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"（我是醫療部門的正式幹員。小麗薩你......跟著凱爾希醫生學習所以算個見習醫生，大概。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"原來如此......啊！二位是在去議事廳的路上對吧？是我擅自攔下了各位，抱歉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然理應由長官接待二位，但是十二音街道的確需要長官的幫忙......這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，其實他——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"咳！好了，塔佳娜，你給她們帶路，我先去看看感染者們的情況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"二位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——怎麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道你們的目的，不過現在情況緊急。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你們知道現在沃倫姆德的情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"大裂谷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，和聰明人說話可以略去很多不必要的交代。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"所以現在感染者居民們的反抗情緒空前強烈，如果不希望捲進來，就不要靠近十二音街道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是感染者問題的對策專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，貴司的安托醫生曾和我們有過密切的合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你應該知道，我們可以幫上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"未必需要。我們不該讓客人立刻捲入麻煩，這也會給我們帶來麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......那麼，安托在這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......她現在不在鎮上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那她在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"她——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不好了！打起來了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那、那些感染者有武器！怎麼回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們用、用刀！？會出人命吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者問題對策專家，是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"跟我來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["亞葉","鈴蘭"]}]}
